WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.668
(dramatic piano music)

00:00:02.668 --> 00:00:06.990
- I've been called all
kinds of things, Casper,

00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:11.583
Snow White, ugly, (light chuckling)

00:00:11.583 --> 00:00:15.141
just all kinds of mean, terrible things.

00:00:15.141 --> 00:00:17.965
People have said that I
wouldn't make it as a model,

00:00:17.965 --> 00:00:19.382
but I am a model.

00:00:20.617 --> 00:00:24.718
(hip-hop music)

00:00:24.718 --> 00:00:26.449
I'm Diandra Forrest,

00:00:26.449 --> 00:00:28.662
I was one of the first
models with albinism

00:00:28.662 --> 00:00:32.137
signed to a major modeling agency.

00:00:32.137 --> 00:00:35.837
Albinism is a gene that
causes lack of pigment

00:00:35.837 --> 00:00:37.837
in hair, skin, and eyes.

00:00:38.769 --> 00:00:39.840
I grew up in the Bronx,

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:43.932
so there's a lot of either
blacks or Hispanics.

00:00:43.932 --> 00:00:46.706
People were always like,
"What are you?," you know.

00:00:46.706 --> 00:00:48.717
I'd be like, "Yeah, I'm
black or African American,"

00:00:48.717 --> 00:00:50.628
and it’s like, "No, you're not."

00:00:50.628 --> 00:00:54.795
I'm just, "Okay, how are you
gonna tell me what I am?"

00:00:56.221 --> 00:01:00.388
Rain is my daughter, my
eight-week now old daughter.

00:01:01.999 --> 00:01:05.867
We're a very blended
family, (light laughing)

00:01:05.867 --> 00:01:08.755
when it comes to skin color.

00:01:08.755 --> 00:01:10.550
Black comes in all shades,

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:14.301
so we're just adding more
complexions to my family.

00:01:14.301 --> 00:01:16.796
(light piano music)

00:01:16.796 --> 00:01:19.703
I walked the runaway with
Rain during Fashion Week

00:01:19.703 --> 00:01:21.878
and she slept the whole time.

00:01:21.878 --> 00:01:24.621
I want her to grow up to be,
you know, her own person,

00:01:24.621 --> 00:01:27.004
not afraid to ask
questions, know who she is

00:01:27.004 --> 00:01:30.232
and be interested to know
who other people are as well.

00:01:30.232 --> 00:01:32.927
(light piano music)

00:01:32.927 --> 00:01:35.260
I didn't always feel beautiful.

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:36.671
Words do hurt, you know.

00:01:36.671 --> 00:01:39.889
I am bothered by things people say,

00:01:39.889 --> 00:01:42.388
but, you know there's beauty in everybody

00:01:42.388 --> 00:01:46.092
and I think it should be celebrated.

00:01:46.092 --> 00:01:48.000
Once you feel the confidence

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.176
and know who you are as a person,

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:53.093
it can't really affect you anymore.

